Your stone spikes grow in length, instantly dealing [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; SP 100)] Physical damage and disarming targets hit for [4, 6, 7, 8, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage increases with Spellpower and the chance to disarm increases with either Spellpower or Physical Power, whichever is greater.
